WEBVTT

00:19.920 --> 00:24.291
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.291 --> 00:28.896
Oto mo naku kokoro ni
fureru toki ni

00:28.896 --> 00:36.098
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura ni wa
kodoku no namida

00:36.570 --> 00:41.408
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.408 --> 00:52.182
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.219 --> 00:54.355
Mamoritai

00:54.355 --> 00:56.590
Shinjitai

00:56.590 --> 01:00.894
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.894 --> 01:05.165
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.165 --> 01:09.503
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.503 --> 01:12.973
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:12.973 --> 01:21.347
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:30.424 --> 01:34.383
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:34.962 --> 01:37.731
Aren't you that
Seimei's grandson?

01:37.731 --> 01:41.101
Don't call me grandson!
I'm Masahiro.

01:41.101 --> 01:44.901
Abe no Masahiro! So what
if my grandfather is famous!

01:46.473 --> 01:49.376
You're beginning to see it,
aren't you?

01:49.376 --> 01:52.880
That's right! I remember
everything now!

01:52.880 --> 01:56.338
My grandfather sealed
my second sight.

01:58.052 --> 02:01.351
The Palace Burns at Twilight

02:06.727 --> 02:10.064
Good job! Your coming-of-age
ceremony was tiring, wasn't it?

02:10.064 --> 02:12.533
My little and cute Masahiro
has grown up...

02:12.533 --> 02:14.601
Time really flies.

02:14.601 --> 02:17.938
Coming of age at thirteen.
That's considered late!

02:17.938 --> 02:21.375
Well, don't worry about it.
I'm happy for you.

02:21.375 --> 02:24.278
It's like a hopeless protégé
has become independent.

02:24.278 --> 02:26.447
I don't remember
becoming your protégé!

02:26.447 --> 02:29.616
But is it really all right for
you to leave the banquet?

02:29.616 --> 02:32.414
After all, you're the
guest of honor today!

02:33.821 --> 02:37.624
I've been so anxious all morning
that I couldn't eat anything.

02:37.624 --> 02:41.161
And the guests kept coming.
I'm totally exhausted.

02:41.161 --> 02:44.531
Well... the nobility lack
excitement in their lives.

02:44.531 --> 02:47.067
So they have come to see
the coming-of-age ceremony...

02:47.067 --> 02:48.635
of the great onmyouji's
grandson.

02:48.635 --> 02:51.672
Well! I'm not some exhibit
for display!

02:51.672 --> 02:54.698
Now now, don't be so sulky.

02:55.175 --> 02:56.699
Masahiro!

02:57.277 --> 02:58.779
Father...

02:58.779 --> 03:01.348
I'm sorry. I was a little tired,

03:01.348 --> 03:04.384
so I thought I would go
and rest in my room.

03:04.384 --> 03:06.220
That's all right...

03:06.220 --> 03:10.680
I didn't think that so many
guests would turn up either...

03:11.625 --> 03:14.428
By the way, Masahiro,
I'd like you...

03:14.428 --> 03:17.056
to go somewhere
with me tomorrow.

03:17.631 --> 03:20.234
- Together with you, Father?
- Yes.

03:20.234 --> 03:23.036
To Lord Fujiwara no
Michinaga's residence.

03:23.036 --> 03:26.306
He'd like to meet Abe no
Seimei's youngest grandson...

03:26.306 --> 03:29.571
now that he's come of age.

03:29.910 --> 03:32.879
- I'm counting on you.
- I understand.

03:34.581 --> 03:38.685
Wow, Fujiwara no Michinaga wants
to meet you face to face.

03:38.685 --> 03:40.687
That's an honor...

03:40.687 --> 03:44.057
- Really?
- What do you mean "really"?

03:44.057 --> 03:46.527
Fujiwara no Michinaga rapidly
rose up the ranks...

03:46.527 --> 03:49.596
from being Minister of the Right
to Minister of the Left.

03:49.596 --> 03:53.467
He's now a man with power and
is able to control events.

03:53.467 --> 03:56.370
- You should feel honored!
- Bah!

03:56.370 --> 04:00.040
I'm not happy that he wants
to meet Seimei's grandson.

04:00.040 --> 04:01.542
It can't be helped...

04:01.542 --> 04:04.444
If you're unhappy, then
you must surpass Seimei!

04:04.444 --> 04:08.982
Yes, I will definitely surpass
my grandfather one day!

04:08.982 --> 04:11.314
It's good that you have
realized this. Do your best!

04:16.790 --> 04:20.093
- Hey? Where's the carriage?
- What? We're walking there.

04:20.093 --> 04:21.929
What? Walking?!

04:21.929 --> 04:25.831
Don't complain when you're
always riding on my shoulder!

04:26.300 --> 04:29.701
Stop, Masahiro!
Don't be so violent!

04:30.103 --> 04:33.140
- This is training. Training!
- Training?!

04:33.140 --> 04:36.443
You're training me?
Stop kidding me!

04:36.443 --> 04:40.480
Stop talking back!
Come on, Father. Let's go.

04:40.480 --> 04:42.883
The being that's riding
on your shoulder...

04:42.883 --> 04:44.578
That's right, Yoshimasa.
You tell him!

04:47.788 --> 04:50.557
Yoshimasa, thank you
for coming.

04:50.557 --> 04:53.185
- Come closer.
- Yes.

04:56.396 --> 04:58.699
Anyone would be nervous
in this situation.

04:58.699 --> 05:02.936
There are many nobles who said
things they shouldn't have...

05:02.936 --> 05:06.804
and ended up being bullied
and degraded by Michinaga.

05:06.907 --> 05:10.377
Listen, Masahiro, first
impressions are crucial.

05:10.377 --> 05:14.147
So try your best to
appear as a nice, earnest,

05:14.147 --> 05:18.015
and diligent apprentice onmyouji.

05:18.518 --> 05:21.487
Hey! Don't ignore me!

05:21.989 --> 05:26.187
I'm being nice and trying to tell
you the things to be careful of.

05:26.727 --> 05:29.630
So you should at least
answer me...

05:29.630 --> 05:31.832
Hey, Masahiro!
Say, "Yes." Say it!

05:31.832 --> 05:34.858
- Come on, Seimei's grandson!
- Don't call me grandson!

05:45.512 --> 05:49.750
Lord Michinaga, there is
actually an ayakashi here...

05:49.750 --> 05:52.810
though I know that
you cannot see it.

05:53.487 --> 05:56.657
This ayakashi is...
teasing Masahiro.

05:56.657 --> 05:59.159
What... Are you serious?

05:59.159 --> 06:02.696
What kind of form does
this ayakashi have?

06:02.696 --> 06:06.223
- I look like this, Michinaga.
- Yoshimasa...

06:06.266 --> 06:08.769
If you are so calm
about this,

06:08.769 --> 06:10.837
then this ayakashi
means no harm?

06:10.837 --> 06:14.775
Yes, of course.
You don't have to worry.

06:14.775 --> 06:18.871
So... where is this
ayakashi right now?

06:19.479 --> 06:21.882
You're looking in the
wrong direction.

06:21.882 --> 06:25.750
- I'm here! I'm here! Hello!
- Mokkun!!

06:26.019 --> 06:29.022
- Masahiro.
- Y-Yes!

06:29.022 --> 06:31.684
You are indeed Yoshimasa's son.

06:32.125 --> 06:35.062
Though you haven't had
onmyouji training yet,

06:35.062 --> 06:38.332
you can see supernatural things
which others can't see.

06:38.332 --> 06:42.035
- Oh... No... That is...
- Say that you have trained...

06:42.035 --> 06:45.739
No, that you were trained
before you knew anything!

06:45.739 --> 06:47.674
I'm depending on you, Masahiro.

06:47.674 --> 06:52.077
Please study hard and
work for me.

06:52.679 --> 06:54.314
Yes, I'll do my best!

06:54.314 --> 06:57.943
Look, you have been praised
because of my help.

06:59.753 --> 07:03.657
Masahiro, I need to discuss
things with Lord Michinaga.

07:03.657 --> 07:06.751
Why don't you take a stroll
in the garden?

07:07.461 --> 07:09.258
Oh... I understand.

07:16.570 --> 07:18.538
He is amazing...

07:18.538 --> 07:21.942
Yeah, the first
Fujiwara, Kamatari,

07:21.942 --> 07:23.977
was more modest though.

07:23.977 --> 07:28.348
Wow, you even know what
happened centuries ago.

07:28.348 --> 07:32.119
Like I said, there's
nothing that I don't know.

07:32.119 --> 07:34.815
So it's true that you have
lived for a long time.

07:35.188 --> 07:37.290
Actually, it's only recently...

07:37.290 --> 07:40.191
that Michinaga has become
this powerful.

07:41.428 --> 07:44.831
Hey, I think this garden alone
is bigger than my house!

07:44.831 --> 07:47.467
Oh, this is nothing.

07:47.467 --> 07:51.801
The Great Imperial Palace is so
large that you'll be shocked!

07:52.239 --> 07:55.008
- I wonder if I'll get lost?
- Leave it to me!

07:55.008 --> 07:58.078
If you get lost,
I'll guide you around.

07:58.078 --> 08:01.782
What?! You intend to go into the
Great Imperial Palace with me?!

08:01.782 --> 08:03.750
It's fine, don't worry...

08:03.750 --> 08:07.087
The Great Imperial Palace is
the nest of strange monsters.

08:07.087 --> 08:10.682
It won't make a difference even
if I'm added to the count.

08:13.960 --> 08:15.518
Hey, Mokkun...

08:16.563 --> 08:18.827
Why do you stay with me?

08:18.899 --> 08:22.035
Initially, you were
with me because...

08:22.035 --> 08:24.902
I couldn't see monsters
and spirits.

08:25.172 --> 08:28.300
But now that I can see them,
there's no need to worry.

08:28.442 --> 08:31.745
I've come of age,
and I'm an adult now.

08:31.745 --> 08:33.770
That's just how it seems.

08:34.047 --> 08:35.749
That's true...

08:35.749 --> 08:38.051
But I'm working hard
in my training...

08:38.051 --> 08:41.154
So you can go back to
my grandfather's side.

08:41.154 --> 08:44.317
What's this? Are you
trying to get rid of me?!

08:45.091 --> 08:47.423
Ah! Mokkun, could it be...

08:47.494 --> 08:51.055
that you don't want to leave me
because you'd miss me?

08:54.301 --> 08:57.134
Oh, did I guess right?!

08:59.906 --> 09:02.067
W-Wait up, Mokkun!!

09:05.879 --> 09:08.245
What on earth is it?

09:09.349 --> 09:11.340
Mokkun, what's going on?

09:12.252 --> 09:13.981
There was something here.

09:14.788 --> 09:18.859
Here? But I don't sense anything.

09:18.859 --> 09:21.027
It's already gone.

09:21.027 --> 09:23.230
But there was certainly
something here...

09:23.230 --> 09:26.700
A paranormal I'm not
familiar with.

09:26.700 --> 09:29.503
Was it a curse directed
at Lord Michinaga?

09:29.503 --> 09:32.233
No, it wasn't anything
like a curse.

09:32.439 --> 09:34.236
Well, what could it be?

09:34.641 --> 09:39.010
Hey, Masahiro... Why don't you
find out for yourself?

09:41.047 --> 09:44.851
Well... But I'm still
undergoing training...

09:44.851 --> 09:47.220
Who was it that just said...

09:47.220 --> 09:50.917
"I've come of age,
and I'm an adult now"?!

09:52.125 --> 09:54.821
Excuse me, what are
you doing?

09:59.065 --> 10:01.090
What are you doing out here?

10:01.434 --> 10:03.732
What is that creature
with you?

10:04.271 --> 10:07.468
- You... can see this thing?
- Don't call me a thing!

10:07.574 --> 10:09.940
It's the daughter of
the Minister of the Left.

10:10.277 --> 10:12.212
If you can see me,

10:12.212 --> 10:15.048
can you see other supernatural
creatures, too?

10:15.048 --> 10:16.538
Yes.

10:17.017 --> 10:20.282
It must be tough for
a noble princess...

10:21.454 --> 10:25.692
Master Seimei's protecting me,
so I'm sure I'll be safe.

10:25.692 --> 10:28.354
And my father says so as well.

10:28.662 --> 10:31.358
Grandfather has set up
a magical barrier.

10:31.531 --> 10:34.534
You are the boy that came
with Lord Yoshimasa, right?

10:34.534 --> 10:37.137
Yes, I'm Masahiro.

10:37.137 --> 10:41.005
Masahiro, are you going
to become an onmyouji?

10:41.608 --> 10:43.276
Yes.

10:43.276 --> 10:45.478
Since you are
Master Seimei's grandson,

10:45.478 --> 10:48.345
you will surely become
a wonderful onmyouji.

10:48.815 --> 10:51.117
There are many good onmyouji...

10:51.117 --> 10:53.813
who aren't Seimei's grandson.

10:54.554 --> 10:57.682
Yes... you're right.
I'm sorry.

10:59.292 --> 11:02.028
No... it's all right...

11:02.028 --> 11:05.794
- I must go now.
- Hey!

11:17.210 --> 11:20.441
That princess was calm
when she saw me.

11:20.680 --> 11:24.684
When people see me, they're
usually scared out of their wits.

11:24.684 --> 11:29.089
She probably believes that a
great onmyouji is protecting her,

11:29.089 --> 11:31.023
so she doesn't feel uneasy.

11:31.157 --> 11:34.394
Seimei truly is awesome...

11:34.394 --> 11:36.555
Hey, are you listening?!

11:36.930 --> 11:40.033
Yes! I'll surpass my
grandfather one day!!

11:40.033 --> 11:42.263
Well, good luck!

11:42.469 --> 11:45.700
Anyway, that princess was
cute, wasn't she?

11:48.608 --> 11:51.543
Got a crush on her, huh?

11:51.711 --> 11:53.611
Shut up!

12:06.292 --> 12:10.196
My father must have finished
talking to Lord Michinaga by now.

12:10.196 --> 12:14.034
You sure talked for a
long time with that princess.

12:14.034 --> 12:15.831
Masahiro...

12:19.039 --> 12:20.907
Lord Yukinari...

12:20.907 --> 12:25.311
Thank you for being in my ceremony
to give me a crown yesterday.

12:25.311 --> 12:27.547
No, it's all right.

12:27.547 --> 12:29.883
I had asked Lord Michinaga
to let me...

12:29.883 --> 12:32.085
give you the crown
in the ceremony.

12:32.085 --> 12:35.655
Master Seimei was the one who
helped me when I was cursed.

12:35.655 --> 12:38.180
So this is my way of
showing my gratitude.

12:38.858 --> 12:40.960
From now on,
I'll do my best...

12:40.960 --> 12:43.563
to fulfill my role as
your guardian.

12:43.563 --> 12:47.158
By the way, were you talking
to someone just now?

12:48.268 --> 12:51.705
Me, me! I was talking
to Masahiro!

12:51.705 --> 12:54.708
Oh, you can't see me?!
That's a pity!

12:54.708 --> 12:57.199
I have a lot of things
to talk about too!

12:57.610 --> 12:59.510
Is something wrong?

12:59.879 --> 13:02.549
No, my shoulder's just
a bit stiff...

13:02.549 --> 13:04.676
Masahiro, you're mean!

13:04.818 --> 13:07.787
I was practicing my spells
and mantras just now.

13:08.054 --> 13:10.249
That must be what you heard.

13:10.323 --> 13:11.847
I see...

13:11.958 --> 13:14.928
You are always practicing
no matter where you are...

13:14.928 --> 13:17.396
You are truly
Master Seimei's grandson.

13:18.164 --> 13:19.859
Grandson again...

13:21.634 --> 13:24.571
- I'm sorry.
- No, no.

13:24.571 --> 13:27.062
You just need to
get used to wearing it.

13:27.741 --> 13:29.971
Mok... ku!!

13:30.376 --> 13:32.212
Yes, what is it?

13:32.212 --> 13:34.737
Yukinari seems like
a nice guy, doesn't he?

13:35.415 --> 13:37.183
It's nothing.

13:37.183 --> 13:40.243
You'll be working in the onmyou
dorms from tomorrow.

13:40.453 --> 13:44.856
If there's any question,
feel free to ask me.

13:47.494 --> 13:49.860
Is there something wrong?

13:50.296 --> 13:52.457
N-Nothing's wrong.

13:52.699 --> 13:56.002
With the ceremony and Lord
Michinaga asking to see you,

13:56.002 --> 13:59.199
you must still be nervous
after all that's happened.

13:59.439 --> 14:02.142
Getting some rest
is essential.

14:02.142 --> 14:04.940
- Yeah...
- Well, I'll see you around.

14:08.148 --> 14:11.515
- That hurt!
- Mokkun!!

14:12.118 --> 14:14.487
That was spectacular,
wasn't it?

14:14.487 --> 14:18.291
Especially that complete spin.
No one else can do it!

14:18.291 --> 14:20.426
What would have
happened if you got caught...

14:20.426 --> 14:22.495
on his headgear and
Lord Yukinari noticed?

14:22.495 --> 14:24.864
I thought he would
notice something.

14:24.864 --> 14:26.661
But he didn't notice at all.

14:28.234 --> 14:31.271
What's wrong, Masahiro?
Are you feeling ill?

14:31.271 --> 14:35.139
I think you need to rest,
just like Yukinari said.

14:44.217 --> 14:48.950
I feel as though I've spent the
whole day just running around.

14:49.189 --> 14:52.425
Yeah, you run around
doing chores day after day.

14:52.425 --> 14:54.222
It's tough to be a trainee.

15:03.636 --> 15:06.272
Due to conspiracies and
feuds in the palace,

15:06.272 --> 15:08.708
there're many small
demons hanging around.

15:08.708 --> 15:11.377
It's ironic that there
are small demons...

15:11.377 --> 15:14.781
even in the onmyou dorms
where onmyouji are training.

15:14.781 --> 15:17.383
Well, if they don't plan
to do any harm,

15:17.383 --> 15:20.477
it's best to leave the
weak demons alone.

15:21.988 --> 15:24.324
Masahiro, are you going
to the library?

15:24.324 --> 15:25.892
- Yes.
- Pardon me...

15:25.892 --> 15:28.561
But could you return
these scrolls for me?

15:28.561 --> 15:30.129
- Yes.
- Sorry!

15:30.129 --> 15:32.165
Could you return
these as well?

15:32.165 --> 15:35.157
And could you distribute
these copies for me?

15:37.237 --> 15:39.364
Work harder... trainee!

15:42.775 --> 15:45.845
Hey, shall we go
home soon?

15:45.845 --> 15:48.014
A little while longer...

15:48.014 --> 15:52.352
Since we're here, I must read the
records of the evil spirits...

15:52.352 --> 15:55.412
who have attacked each
generation of emperors.

15:57.557 --> 16:01.152
What's this aura? It's creating
a stir and making me queasy...

16:01.628 --> 16:03.289
Yeah, me too.

16:10.870 --> 16:13.640
It's in the direction
of the Emperor's palace!

16:13.640 --> 16:15.808
- It's a fire.
- Anyone can see that!

16:15.808 --> 16:18.800
But it's not any ordinary fire.

16:19.746 --> 16:21.781
The fire is probably
spreading from...

16:21.781 --> 16:24.079
the Seiryou quarters
to the inner palace.

16:24.784 --> 16:26.953
- Oh no!!
- Masahiro!

16:26.953 --> 16:28.454
Try concentrating hard...

16:28.454 --> 16:30.757
Amidst the auras of
panicking humans,

16:30.757 --> 16:32.918
- there's something else there.
- Yes.

16:35.862 --> 16:39.229
[chant]

16:46.306 --> 16:47.874
I sense a monster!

16:47.874 --> 16:50.308
I've never seen anything
like this...

16:50.710 --> 16:53.246
I've sensed this
presence before...

16:53.246 --> 16:55.237
East Third Palace!

17:05.291 --> 17:08.027
- What's wrong, Masahiro?!
- There's something paranormal!

17:08.027 --> 17:09.696
In Michinaga's house?

17:09.696 --> 17:12.865
You sensed something
there the other day.

17:12.865 --> 17:14.628
Could it be...

17:15.168 --> 17:16.931
Masahiro!

17:18.004 --> 17:20.707
What is it? You seem
to be in such a hurry.

17:20.707 --> 17:23.810
- Where's Lord Michinaga?
- He said he's coming soon.

17:23.810 --> 17:27.610
We just heard about the fire and
are about to go to the palace.

17:32.185 --> 17:34.754
Masahiro, you can't go in
without permission!

17:34.754 --> 17:36.984
Hey you, where are you going?!

17:42.161 --> 17:44.356
Grandfather's magical barrier
has been breached!

17:45.498 --> 17:48.433
- Masahiro!!
- No, don't come out!

18:09.288 --> 18:12.348
[chant]

18:37.383 --> 18:39.752
Soldiers that confront,
men that fight,

18:39.752 --> 18:42.084
fall into place and
go forth with might!

19:03.176 --> 19:05.745
What... was that?

19:05.745 --> 19:07.610
I don't know...

19:08.314 --> 19:10.305
but it's something
supernatural.

19:11.451 --> 19:14.614
Oh... I-I'm sorry!

19:16.489 --> 19:18.825
Oh, it's probably safe now!

19:18.825 --> 19:21.294
I'll call Grandfather later
and ask him to...

19:21.294 --> 19:23.262
set up a stronger
magical barrier,

19:23.262 --> 19:26.356
so no one will be able to
harm you, First Princess!

19:27.467 --> 19:30.536
It's Akiko! Don't call me
First Princess!

19:30.536 --> 19:32.629
I'm Akiko, Masahiro.

19:33.506 --> 19:35.633
Aki... ko?

19:35.975 --> 19:39.001
Thank you for saving me.

19:40.913 --> 19:42.849
Masahiro!

19:42.849 --> 19:46.586
- What happened just now?!
- Akiko, are you all right?!

19:46.586 --> 19:48.855
Father... Lord Yukinari...

19:48.855 --> 19:50.590
There's no need
to be alarmed.

19:50.590 --> 19:53.926
Masahiro exorcized the
evil monster.

19:53.926 --> 19:56.095
- What?
- It was amazing.

19:56.095 --> 19:59.065
Masahiro will become
a magnificent onmyouji.

19:59.065 --> 20:01.534
You did very well, Masahiro...

20:01.534 --> 20:03.866
As expected of Seimei's
grandson.

20:05.538 --> 20:07.836
Seimei's grandson...

20:12.979 --> 20:16.676
The palace fire sounds
pretty disturbing...

20:17.083 --> 20:19.485
There was no sign of
anything last night.

20:19.485 --> 20:23.512
So if the fire started where
there was previously nothing...

20:23.656 --> 20:26.392
Besides, Masahiro was
the only one...

20:26.392 --> 20:28.860
who ran to East Third Palace...

20:30.296 --> 20:33.959
Somehow... I sense
chaos ahead...

20:36.402 --> 20:39.338
Well, you shouldn't
have refused...

20:39.338 --> 20:42.008
Michinaga's offer of a reward.

20:42.008 --> 20:46.179
You could have at least asked
for a carriage to send us home!

20:46.179 --> 20:50.082
You know, I entered his
house without permission.

20:50.082 --> 20:53.152
If he'd wanted to punish me,
he could have!

20:53.152 --> 20:55.755
I don't want to walk home!

20:55.755 --> 20:57.620
- You...
- Excuse me...

20:58.024 --> 21:01.152
This is from Miss Akiko,
as a token of gratitude.

21:03.596 --> 21:06.360
Hey! You're grinning!

21:07.600 --> 21:10.069
You're totally overwhelmed now.

21:10.069 --> 21:12.872
No, I was thinking
that it smelled nice.

21:12.872 --> 21:16.375
"I was so cool in front
of the princess today."

21:16.375 --> 21:18.978
Isn't that what you
were thinking?

21:18.978 --> 21:21.970
No, I wasn't!

21:22.148 --> 21:26.052
Well, it wouldn't have gone so
well if I hadn't been there.

21:26.052 --> 21:27.986
That's not true!

21:42.768 --> 21:53.804
Fukai yami no naka de
kimi no koe ga kikoeta

21:54.080 --> 22:05.321
"Shinjiteru" tada hitokoto
boku no kokoro ni hibiite kita

22:05.658 --> 22:11.153
Itsumo kimi ga soba ni ite kureta ne

22:11.364 --> 22:16.927
Itsumo boku ni yuuki kurete ita

22:19.171 --> 22:29.548
Boku-tachi no mirai wo
mamoritsuzukeru tame ni

22:29.548 --> 22:36.181
Taisetsu na kimi ni
yakusokusuru yo

22:36.289 --> 22:41.494
Boku wa akiramenai

22:41.494 --> 22:47.300
Motto motto boku wa
boku wo koete

22:47.300 --> 22:53.830
Kitto kitto kitto

22:59.912 --> 23:02.506
Next Episode

23:24.470 --> 23:26.005
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

